{"entry_id": 1146, "lemma": "γονυπετέω", "page": 64, "text": "γονυπετέω, I fall on my knees before (in supplication), supplicate, entreat.", "gloss": "I fall on my knees before", "status": "ok", "note": ""}
{"entry_id": 1149, "lemma": "γραπτός", "page": 64, "text": "γραπτός, written.", "gloss": "written", "status": "ok", "note": ""}
{"entry_id": 1152, "lemma": "γραώδης", "page": 64, "text": "γραώδης (anilis), belonging to old women, such as old women tell.", "gloss": "belonging to old women, such as old women tell", "status": "ok", "note": ""}
{"entry_id": 1154, "lemma": "γυμνάζω", "page": 64, "text": "γυμνάζω, I train by physical exercise: hence, train in widest sense; with gen. of sphere, 2 Pet. ii 14.", "gloss": "I train by physical exercise", "status": "ok", "note": ""}
{"entry_id": 1155, "lemma": "γυμνασία", "page": 64, "text": "γυμνασία (physical) exercise, in a wide sense, ‘escarum, balnearum, uenationum et huius modi’ (Pelagius).", "gloss": "(physical) exercise", "status": "ok", "note": ""}
{"entry_id": 1156, "lemma": "γυμνιτεύω", "page": 64, "text": "γυμνιτεύω, I am habitually γυμνός, that is, I wear the under-garment (χιτών, tunica) only, it being the regular practice to wear two garments.", "gloss": "I am habitually γυμνός", "status": "ok", "note": ""}
{"entry_id": 1158, "lemma": "γυμνότης", "page": 64, "text": "γυμνότης, nakedness, cf. γυμνός, γυμνιτεύω.", "gloss": "nakedness", "status": "ok", "note": ""}
{"entry_id": 1159, "lemma": "γυναικάριον", "page": 64, "text": "γυναικάριον (muliercula), a woman with all a woman's weakness, a poor weak woman.", "gloss": "a woman with all a woman's weakness", "status": "ok", "note": ""}
