{"entry_id": 1162, "lemma": "Γώγ", "page": 65, "text": "Γώγ, Gog, a name borrowed from Ezekiel (xxxviii 2 ff., where = prince over Mesech and Thubal), to indicate a race or races to be led astray by Satan at the end of the thousand years.", "gloss": "Gog, a name borrowed from Ezekiel", "status": "ok", "note": ""}
